     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Supporting adaptation and implementation of the Sustainable Procurement Index for Health 
2. Provide coordination and secretarial services for Joint SHiPP/SPHS/One Planet Platforms.
3. Conduct capacity building for sustainable procurement for the health systems and ministries on adaptation and implementation of less - toxic, carbon intensive and high resource consuming technologies
4. Convene the 5th global Suppliers Forum
5.Promoting equitable access to sustainable health products</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
    </period>
